# Line endings (2026-09-27). Every text file is stored with LF and checked out with LF, on
# every machine, so `core.autocrlf` no longer warns on each status and a diff never shows a
# whole file for its endings. Git tells text from binary by content (`auto`); the fonts,
# icons and installers are left alone. The index was already all LF when this was added
# (400 text files, 77 binary), so nothing renormalized.
* text=auto eol=lf
